{"ID":"20240513083159-6ocq5je","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083159-6ocq5je","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083159-6ocq5je\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151425-55ltsmh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151425-55ltsmh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513151425-55ltsmh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:1123,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:1123\u0026#125;","title":"181","type":"doc","updated":"20240515122503"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513151425-55ltsmh","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 1043px;","id":"20240513151425-55ltsmh","updated":"20240515122503"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期：2008/05/07"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"157-1 C, CY"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Male"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"39"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2008/05/07"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手足冰冷，容易疲勞，腎結石，脫髮，皮膚乾癢（乾癬）"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 夏天或氣候溫暖時手足溫，天冷時手足易冰冷。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 便秘，有時2-3天一次。排便不暢，如廁後有時仍有便意，大便時鞭，呈現條狀但不粗，有排氣。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 小便中黃有泡沫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 胃口好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 睡眠不好，有時不易入睡，早上起床後仍然疲累，會賴床"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、 口渴尚好，喜喝溫熱水"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洪大中空(勞證)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃濕，中間有無苔的紅點"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脾區跟肝區一樣大"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" → 表濕盛，脾主濕，其濕在血脈神經中不在關   節，所以關節不痛但會很累。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區有白點及橫紋 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 表肝中有積毒及積肥氣，只要生活飲食正  常，B肝帶原絕對不會有問題。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腎陽較差"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 癆症"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"桂枝5錢 麻黃3錢 白朮3錢 炮附子3錢 炙甘草3錢 知母5錢 防風3錢 白芍6錢"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" → 桂枝芍藥知母湯 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"杏仁3錢 薏仁5錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 麻杏薏甘湯，乾癬的處方就是麻杏薏甘湯，乾癬表皮是乾的下面卻是濕的，麻黃杏仁等量，薏仁去濕止癢，所以可以加重到五錢，沒有聽過吃薏仁而死的，杏仁潤肺是滋潤皮膚，麻黃開毛孔，麻黃將肺打開，大量水進入腎臟，滑石澤瀉茯苓幫助結石清出。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"滑石6錢 澤瀉5錢 茯苓5錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 腎結石"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"側柏葉5錢 當歸3錢 何首烏5錢 柴胡3錢 鬱金5錢 補骨脂3錢 巴戟天3錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 側柏葉當歸首烏生髮，柴胡鬱金清肝。腎其華在髮，肝主生發，一做化療就掉頭髮，表示肝受傷，所以在補腎時也同時疏肝清肝，頭髮會長得很快，補骨脂巴戟天把陽壯回來陰也補足。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枳實2錢大黃2錢 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 通便"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"便秘不管原因為何，就算有寄生蟲或大腸癌等其他原因，治療便秘一定要問病人小便，小便淡白，不為便秘所困，甚至一星期不大便也不覺難過，這就是寒實，寒就是腸子沒有蠕動，實就是東西結到，我們要寫寒實的原因，就是要開去寒及去實的藥，大黃附子細辛湯就是這樣來的！若是寒比較重實比較少，大黃少一點附子多一點；如果一星期一次，就大黃多一點附子少一點。小便黃有泡沫就是熱實，就要考慮承氣湯或大柴胡湯方向。大柴胡湯中一定要有大黃與芒硝。小便有泡沫，我們要注意腎臟。如果有排氣，表示大腸內堵到不多，小腸內堵得較多，為小承氣湯；沒有排氣就是大承氣湯症。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"起床易累與腎臟有關，所以我常問患者起床時身體的感覺如何？早上能立刻起床表示陽很夠，陽可以練出來，像少林寺或當兵時一早被挖起來練操，習慣了陽氣就足。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者腎結石發作時，左腰痛痛及左腹，左腳腎石點有壓痛，雙耳腎點無壓痛，可能是吃豬苓湯有清除一部分，左腳近復溜處有壓痛，表示結石在腎較高的位置。 脈洪大中空，這是癆症。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈洪大中空有兩種，一是芤脈為失血或貧血，但其手掌是紅的，故為癆症。癆症其手臂血管會比較明顯，當人年老時手臂血管也會明顯，是因陽漸虛，陽比較少陰比較多，皮膚肌肉下陷，相對血管較浮。癆症的人血脈賁張粗大，是因血脈中除了血之外還有濕，血管會變得比較大，所以脈大為癆，為什麼為癆，因會比較累，比較容易倦怠，易精神不濟。癆症有一重要的特點是不容易胖，吃很多也不容易胖。吃很多手腳卻容易冷，吃當歸四逆湯或其他方劑都不對，必須要吃桂枝芍藥知母湯。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}